{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06010","headline":"黎拾遗昕裴秀才迪见过秋夜对雨之作 · 王维","name":"黎拾遗昕裴秀才迪见过秋夜对雨之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促织鸣已急，轻衣行向重。\n寒灯坐高馆，秋雨闻疎钟。\n白法调狂象，玄言问老龙。\n何人顾蓬径，空愧求羊踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}